  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The vision shows a burly rank eight Gu Immortal who raises his head and laughs wildly. Contempt sits on his face until shock replaces it when the Immortal Gu House appears. As a final stand he turns into a rank eight immortal zombie.",
      "chapters": [
        959
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The house absorbs and seals his attacks, then lets the rank seven strike back with them, so he bears most of his own might. The rank seven wins but cannot take his life, abandons the house, and uses it to suppress him deep under the earth before flying away. Grass and trees grow. The plain rises from a mound into a mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        959
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "nameless-mountain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan, watching Shadow Sect’s tribulation scenes, concludes that a wisdom path Gu Immortal of Shadow Sect, Da Li, was the rank eight Great Strength True Martial immortal zombie that was suppressed.",
      "chapters": [
        1020
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sect-affiliation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "char_da_li",
        "char_great_strength_true_martial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ying Wu Xie names that Great Strength True Martial Physique immortal zombie, Da Li, as a rare cultivator of both wisdom path and strength path. When Da Li refined strength path Immortal Gu, Shadow Sect had not yet built Regret Pool, so he left no insignia there to refine those Gu again.",
      "chapters": [
        1104
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dual-cultivation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ying_wu_xie",
        "sys_great_strength_true_martial_physique",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "house_regret_pool"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Enslavement after victorious fight was created by immortal zombie Da Li. He was a second generation split soul of Spectral Soul. After the first generation split soul Purple Mountain True Monarch turned into a purple gold rock, Da Li took over as leader of Shadow Sect.",
      "chapters": [
        1402
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "killer-move-source",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_purple_mountain_true_monarch"
      ]
    }
  ],
